corpus_format: 1
id: handshake-trailing-bytes
title: Handshake with trailing bytes
description: A handshake with one extra byte after the intention field violates exact consumption and is rejected with no bytes sent.
category: handshake
protocol: 777
provenance: hand-authored
initial_state: HANDSHAKE
final_state: HANDSHAKE

step:
  direction: serverbound
  input: 11 00 89 06 09 6C 6F 63 61 6C 68 6F 73 74 63 DD 01 00
  outcome: rejected
  rejection_category: malformed_packet
